  "notes": "This release is a first press and differs from others as the label lists the sides as AS-77, not AS-77-A and AS-77-B. \nEverything else appears the same.\nOn cover: A-77\n\nLaminated gatefold sleeve, thick cardboard. Includes black & blue company inner sleeve promoting other ABC Paramount releases (last promoted record is A-57).\n\nRecorded December 9th, 1964\nJohn Coltrane plays a Selmer saxophone\n\nPrinted in U.S.A.\n\n\n",
